  "description": "## What's New\n- **About screen** — version, build and release notes in one quiet place\n- **Release notes** now travel with the update, so you know what changed before installing\n- **Manual update check** from Settings → About\n- **Improved handwriting feedback** with clearer, calmer corrections\n- **Added smooth vertical transitions** between practice screens\n\n## Study memory\n- Your tutor's notes are now completely freeform — no fixed headings\n- Notes update by line, so what it already learned is never rewritten"
